found near Griffin Warrior tomb in 
Pylos\n\n[Ancient](http://www.thehistoryblog.com/archives/category/ancient)\n\n[
![](http://www.thehistoryblog.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Pylos-combat-agate-
after-200x129.jpg \"Pylos Combat Agate revealed in all its glory after 
