drawing of the Ring of Nestor in Evans’s Knossos notebook held at the Ashmolean 
Museum in Oxford (specified as notebook 42, pages 82–3, Box 10), and a 
watercolour painting of the ring by E. Gilliéron fils, reproduced in Evans’s 
Palace of Minos (PM III, plate XX A). The book thereby connects the ring to the 
