Ring of Nestor: Hudler and the Journal of Ancient Egyptian Interconnections 
stress doubts and classify the ring among suspect or forged objects, while Ingo 
Pini’s study argues in favor of its authenticity based on comparative 
iconographic and stylistic analysis.", "importance": "core"}], "objectives": 
