{"query": {"id": "20260628150925202013_b4e7aeb3", "handle": "q3", "text": "“Ring
of Nestor” dating Mycenaean period cultural attribution scholarly 
interpretation", "importance": "core"}, "items": [{"id": 
"20260628151420672058_4f9859e3", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Vlachopoulos gives
the Ring of Nestor’s dimensions as 3.29 cm by 2.18 cm and identifies it as the 
