"citations": [8]}, {"id": "20260628151421090745_e0149bf3", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "Palmer identifies ongoing scholarly disputes about whether the Ring of 
Nestor’s imagery represents an epiphany scene, mortuary ritual, or general cult 
