'20260628151417806158_d919de49'], 'kind': 'paragraph'}, {'text': 'Iconographic 
studies emphasize that the Ring of Nestor’s scene belongs to the broader family 
of Minoan and Mycenaean gold signet imagery that combines sacred landscapes, 
